  "description": "Application for a Non-Material Amendment Following a Grant of Planning Permission ref: 24/01224/FUL (Demolition of existing buildings and construction of a part 6/part 8/part 10 storey building comprising social science incubator space (Class E(g)(i)) on the ground floor with ancillary cafe, light industrial employment space (Class E(g)(iii) on the lower ground floor, with halls of residence and ancillary facilities above (sui generis), with provision of associated cycle parking, new public realm, loading bay and landscaping) granted on 22.08.2025.\r\rAmendment sought :\r-To amend the BREEAM-related conditions so that the trigger for submission of the required details is extended from six months to twelve months from commencement of development, reflecting the approved phased implementation of the scheme and the delay between demolition and the commencement of the principal construction works.\r- To combine Conditions 26 (BREEAM Shell and Core) and 27 (BREEAM Excellent) to reflect the revised delivery strategy, whereby the commercial floorspace will be fully designed and assessed as part of a single BREEAM process rather than through separate shell-and-core and fit-out stages.\r\r",
